    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n22xdtz4kk2i",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "People who have no contact with coders seem to have no idea how much an entire profession transformed in less than a year due to AI. It is so weird to still see comments here that AI hasn’t changed anything or that AI code is bad or that companies are retreating from AI use. Does not match reality.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n22xdtz4kk2i",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-11T22:00:44.261Z",
      "likes": 516,
      "replies": 31,
      "reposts": 66,
      "score": 8.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.8,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 26.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n22xsngwis2i",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "This is not an argument that AI is all good or a hype post that you should learn AI today or fall behind. I think there is a limited time to engage with this transition and decide how to use AI in ways that make professions work better and center humans. Ignoring reality will not get us there.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n22xsngwis2i",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-11T22:09:00.695Z",
      "likes": 151,
      "replies": 6,
      "reposts": 9,
      "score": 7,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.2,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 26.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25i2e2yi22m",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Researcher Will Depue discovered that 4 top Chinese labs’ models were all trained on Blackwell GPUs (GB200 & GB300), which are fully restricted from sale to China\n\nhis method is purely forensic, no insider information was used\n\nunemploymentlabs.com/checkpoint-f...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n25i2e2yi22m",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-12T22:04:58.647Z",
      "likes": 66,
      "replies": 8,
      "reposts": 11,
      "score": 6.9,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 2.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25jpzcdtk2p",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "🚨 Our Generative AI Lab is releasing Primer: an open source agent-driven system where a teacher talks through lessons & gets back a playable simulation for their students, grounded in pedagogy. We hope educators & researchers build on it. Paper/prompts/code are open: gail.wharton.upenn.edu/primer/",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n25jpzcdtk2p",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-12T22:34:59.292Z",
      "likes": 61,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 14,
      "score": 6.8,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 1.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25higcdhk2x",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Jensen has been leading NVIDIA to invest in superscalers (what some call circular financing). That might be unpleasant for the people who rely on the free but risky flow of capital. If that is doom for the AI industry, then well we really were in a bubble built around a cult of personality.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n25higcdhk2x",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-12T21:54:56.875Z",
      "likes": 6,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 5,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 2.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n25hig6ckk2x",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "But the company is built. Does it stop innovating because of one departure? Is the rest of the AI industry doomed because of his departure? These seem unlikely to me.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n25hig6ckk2x",
